@startuml
actor Sender
participant "Submission Server\n(MSA)" as MSA
participant "Relay Server\n(MTA)" as MTA
participant "Mailbox Server\n(MDA)" as MDA

Sender -> MSA : SMTP submission\nMAIL FROM / RCPT TO / DATA
MSA -> MTA : relay
MTA -> MDA : final delivery

note right of MSA
Adds a Received header
end note

note right of MTA
Adds another Received header
end note

note right of MDA
Stores message in mailbox
end note
@enduml
